    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your heritage consists of Vesperan who are doctors, hunters, or blood mages, who are well-tuned with the nature of blood. You gain bloodsense as a vague sense with a range of 30 feet to notice creatures living or dead with blood, but it is an imprecise sense against bleeding creatures and blood. You can Track if there is a blood trail with a +2 circumstance bonus.</span></p>",
